00:46:17,656 --> 00:46:19,100
People say that.

285
00:46:20,880 --> 00:46:22,540
Buanga killed her.

286
00:46:27,760 --> 00:46:28,896
Mother,

287
00:46:29,130 --> 00:46:31,820
The ghost kills people.
There are only novels.

288
00:46:32,370 --> 00:46:33,660
And importantly,

289
00:46:34,088 --> 00:46:36,800
You didn't hurt Buanga and her father.

290
00:46:37,250 --> 00:46:38,700
Why would she come to avenge?

291
00:46:42,144 --> 00:46:43,100
Yes,

292
00:46:46,370 --> 00:46:48,780
But I did bad thing to her.

293
00:46:56,730 --> 00:46:58,024
I'm afraid.

294
00:46:59,328 --> 00:47:00,300
Ploy,

295
00:47:01,040 --> 00:47:02,900
Can't you go to work tonight?

296
00:47:06,536 --> 00:47:09,060
I couldn't.

297
00:47:11,770 --> 00:47:15,220
I will let my friend come to be with you.

298
00:48:27,330 --> 00:48:29,540
How are you?

299
00:50:25,184 --> 00:50:26,180
Mother,

300
00:51:06,936 --> 00:51:07,980
Mother,

301
00:51:38,112 --> 00:51:40,700
And then there's Duang Khae
who doesn't get along with Buanga.

302
00:51:41,256 --> 00:51:43,980
Came to die mysterious.

303
00:51:45,232 --> 00:51:48,700
The forensic doctor concluded
