304
00:51:49,930 --> 00:51:52,220
But like everyone is willing to believe that.

305
00:51:52,856 --> 00:51:55,260
Because of the vengeance of Buanga.

306
00:52:01,650 --> 00:52:02,420
Ploy,

307
