323
00:55:18,130 --> 00:55:19,620
Chan, you go with me.

324
00:55:21,330 --> 00:55:24,060
This child has never been your child.

325
00:55:25,970 --> 00:55:28,860
This man is not your husband.

326
00:55:30,930 --> 00:55:33,420
